PackageName: canopy
PackageUrl: https://shankar-sachin.github.io/canopy/
License: MIT
LicenseUrl: https://github.com/shankar-sachin/canopy/blob/main/LICENSE
ShortDescription: canopy console. Git and GitHub, everything from the keyboard.
Description: |-
  canopy console puts your whole repository on one screen and every git
  and GitHub action one key away: line-level staging, interactive rebase, bisect,
  worktrees, every repository at once, a command palette, remappable keys and your
  own commands. With the GitHub CLI it also shows pull requests, issues, Actions
  runs, releases and notifications. Teach mode and next steps still explain
  everything. New to git? Try canopy desktop (shankars.canopy-desktop).
Moniker: canopy
